===International players===
This would be the second time in NBA history where an international born and raised player would be considered an underclassman in an NBA draft, as well as the second time a player from the now-former nation of [[SFR Yugoslavia]] would enter the NBA draft as such a player. The following international player successfully applied for early draft entrance.<ref name=tdr />

* {{flagicon|SFR Yugoslavia}}/{{flagicon|CRO}} [[Žan Tabak]] – C, [[KK Split|Split]] ([[First Federal Basketball League|Yugoslavia]])

